                                                "sense_id": "3479a87b-53ab-353a-a907-b74cf31cda48",
                                                "text": "If a journalist speaks for herself, let her say so. If something is true of \"a few\" or \"some\" or \"many\" or, even, \"most\" of us, then let her say that. It may cost a few extra modifiers, but it will prevent the unconscionable reinforcement of the myth that we are all alike."
                                            }
